1
00:00:50,759 --> 00:00:51,920
Hey, Li Wen.

2
00:00:52,079 --> 00:00:53,359
I got scammed.

3
00:00:53,759 --> 00:00:54,399
This sublandlord...

4
00:00:54,399 --> 00:00:55,719
He's a scammer.

5
00:00:56,039 --> 00:00:57,719
The landlord just kicked me out.

6
00:00:58,399 --> 00:00:59,320
Don't panic.

7
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:00,479
Just take your time and tell me.

8
00:01:01,159 --> 00:01:02,600
I rented a place.

9
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,200
The guy told me if I paid a year's rent,

10
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,599
I'd get a thousand off each month.

11
00:01:07,079 --> 00:01:08,159
So I paid it.

12
00:01:08,799 --> 00:01:09,799
Gu Ting, listen.

13
00:01:09,959 --> 00:01:11,879
Send me the sublandlord's info first.

14
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,200
Okay.

15
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,319
Gu Ting, I found him.

16
00:01:24,519 --> 00:01:26,480
This sublandlord's methods aren't very clever.

17
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:28,359
He has another property listed for rent,

18
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,359
so he hasn't skipped town yet.

19
00:01:29,959 --> 00:01:31,400
Listen, I'll go stake him out.

20
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:32,280
I should be able to catch him.

21
00:01:33,599 --> 00:01:35,319
Okay. Thank you.

22
00:01:41,159 --> 00:01:42,000
Old Gu.

23
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:43,439
Gu Ting got scammed.

24
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:54,280
Who are you?

25
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:56,680
You're the one who scammed my friend out of thirty thousand, huh?

26
00:01:57,079 --> 00:01:57,799
Give back the money.

27
00:01:59,159 --> 00:02:00,000
Don't run!

28
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,200
Who's there?

29
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,280
You've got a lot of nerve.

30
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:07,799
Boss Gu.

31
00:02:07,799 --> 00:02:09,479
You dare scam my sweetie out of her money?

32
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,000
You wanna die?

33
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:11,520
Boss Gu.

34
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:13,120
I didn't know she was your daughter.

35
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:15,719
Well, I'll make sure you know right now!

36
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:18,560
You wrong my sweetie, you die.

37
00:02:18,759 --> 00:02:19,439
Gu Yan.

38
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:21,520
What are you doing?

39
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,400
Let go of me!

40
00:02:23,159 --> 00:02:23,960
Think about Gu Ting.

41
00:02:24,159 --> 00:02:24,960
Put the knife down.

42
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:27,120
Leave yourself a way out.

43
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,360
Put it away.

44
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:30,879
He's not worth it.

45
00:02:30,879 --> 00:02:31,680
You hear me?

46
00:02:32,599 --> 00:02:34,400
Talk. Where's the money?

47
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,280
It's already been transferred.

48
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,599
There's only five thousand left.

49
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:37,319
You...

50
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:38,759
Five thousand?

51
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:41,360
You scammed at least three people today.

52
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:42,199
Let me tell you,

53
00:02:42,759 --> 00:02:44,159
you'd better cough up every last cent.

54
00:02:44,479 --> 00:02:45,319
Now get the hell out of here.

55
00:02:47,199 --> 00:02:48,400
Wait, why did you let him go?

56
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,159
Relax, someone will arrest him.

57
00:02:49,159 --> 00:02:50,159
Don't worry.

58
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,280
Oh, right.

59
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,879
Call Gu Ting right now.

60
00:02:52,879 --> 00:02:53,680
She just got scammed,

61
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:54,719
so she must be feeling terrible.

62
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:56,719
Right.

63
00:02:56,719 --> 00:02:57,520
Hurry up.

64
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:01,639
Sweetie.

65
00:03:02,199 --> 00:03:04,000
I got back the money you were scammed out of.

66
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,599
I'll transfer it to you in a minute.

67
00:03:05,879 --> 00:03:06,520
I don't want it.

68
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:07,960
Come on.

69
00:03:09,159 --> 00:03:10,800
Give your dad some credit for trying.

70
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,319
What kind of attitude is that?

71
00:03:12,919 --> 00:03:14,080
Give me a break.

72
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:16,039
Catching the scammer was all Li Wen's doing.

73
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:17,319
What did you even do?

74
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:21,080
I'll treat Li Wen to a meal.

75
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:22,960
If you dare show up, I'm never coming home again!

76
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:23,759
Goodbye.

77
00:03:25,759 --> 00:03:27,039
I heard all of that.

78
00:03:27,039 --> 00:03:27,680
Oh, man.

79
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,199
Looks like you're not invited to dinner.

80
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,560
I'm out of here.

81
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,639
Bye.

82
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:41,759
What did I do to deserve this?

83
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,520
Still haven't found a place?

84
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:05,800
Renting has left me traumatized.

85
00:04:06,319 --> 00:04:09,360
Another youth hostel got exposed for hidden cameras last night.

86
00:04:13,159 --> 00:04:14,680
Then just move back home for now.

87
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:15,960
I'm not going back there.

88
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:21,519
How about this, then.

89
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:23,920
I have a spare room at my place.

90
00:04:27,759 --> 00:04:28,959
Don't get the wrong idea.

91
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,680
If you don't mind,

92
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:32,199
you can stay at my place for the time being.

93
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,439
As for rent and utilities,

94
00:04:34,439 --> 00:04:35,920
we can just split them at market rate.

95
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,199
That works.

96
00:04:41,199 --> 00:04:43,160
But I'll only stay at your place for a month.

97
00:04:43,399 --> 00:04:45,079
I'll move out as soon as I make some money.

98
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,120
Okay.

99
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:49,639
Then, after your classes,

100
00:04:49,959 --> 00:04:51,040
I'll take you to check it out.

101
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:52,639
Yeah.

102
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,399
Sweetie,

103
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,160
I brought you your favorite braised chicken.

104
00:05:27,399 --> 00:05:29,279
You'll be staying in this room.

105
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:31,199
I've already cleaned it up.

106
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,600
Okay.

107
00:05:48,399 --> 00:05:49,519
Your dad.

108
00:05:52,399 --> 00:05:53,519
Kid,

109
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:55,079
is my sweetie with you?

110
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:57,160
Stop bothering people for no reason.

111
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:58,720
Didn't you see the note?

112
00:05:58,759 --> 00:05:59,680
I moved out.

113
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:01,240
Sweetie,

114
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:01,879
you don't understand.

115
00:06:01,879 --> 00:06:03,639
It's a treacherous world out there.

116
00:06:03,639 --> 00:06:05,000
You can't handle it.

117
00:06:05,639 --> 00:06:06,879
I can't believe you don't trust your dad,

118
00:06:06,879 --> 00:06:08,000
and you trust an outsider.

119
00:06:08,199 --> 00:06:09,639
How long have you even known him?

120
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,600
If you don't change your ways,

121
00:06:11,959 --> 00:06:13,399
I'm never going back.

122
00:06:24,759 --> 00:06:25,920
You just can't keep a grown daughter.

123
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,360
I spent 20 years raising her,

124
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,720
only to raise an enemy.

125
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,639
Why don't you reconsider?

126
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:44,600
Get some rest. See you tomorrow.

127
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:58,920
I'll eat it if you don't.

128
00:07:14,279 --> 00:07:17,560
So much for my sweet little girl.

129
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:49,319
I was just thinking about getting back at my dad.

130
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:51,319
I can't believe I actually moved in.

131
00:07:52,439 --> 00:07:53,439
But...

132
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:56,879
He doesn't think I'm that kind of...

133
00:07:56,879 --> 00:07:58,800
...easy girl, does he?

134
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:03,519
But the contract is already signed.

135
00:08:04,279 --> 00:08:06,399
He wouldn't get the wrong idea, right?

136
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,560
I can't believe she's actually staying.

137
00:08:32,399 --> 00:08:33,879
When do you plan

138
00:08:33,879 --> 00:08:35,600
on proposing to me?

139
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,639
Why didn't you give me any warning?

140
00:08:50,799 --> 00:08:52,039
Will you marry me?

141
00:09:01,799 --> 00:09:02,919
From now on,

142
00:09:04,519 --> 00:09:05,360
for the rest of your life,

143
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:07,600
you're stuck with me.

144
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:09,759
There's no escaping.

145
00:09:21,919 --> 00:09:23,120
No, no, no!

146
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,720
She's Gu Ting,

147
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:28,799
not Sun Yao.

148
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:51,120
You got a death wish?

149
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:53,320
Lying to both me and Tingting.

150
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:55,519
Don't you get it?

151
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,960
Gu Ting is dead set on getting rid of you.

152
00:09:58,679 --> 00:09:59,720
I'm just an excuse.

153
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,120
What do you mean?

154
00:10:18,279 --> 00:10:19,320
I'm telling you.

155
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,759
Tingting is my life.

156
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,200
If you dare hurt her,

157
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,200
I'll make you pay.

158
00:10:25,759 --> 00:10:26,960
You've already hurt her,

159
00:10:27,879 --> 00:10:28,879
haven't you?

160
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,279
I'll help you one last time.

161
00:10:46,799 --> 00:10:47,399
After that,

162
00:10:47,759 --> 00:10:49,159
whatever it takes,

163
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:50,600
you convince Tingting to come back.

164
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:13,759
Still coding this late?

165
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,840
Weren't you going to write a novel?

166
00:11:21,039 --> 00:11:22,720
I bought you some reference books.

167
00:11:23,399 --> 00:11:24,480
And some mystery collections.

168
00:11:24,879 --> 00:11:26,919
Not sure if they'll help you.

169
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:33,120
I just made that up.

170
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,480
About writing a detective novel.

171
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,720
I didn't expect her to remember.

172
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:42,200
Thank you.

173
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:45,440
Oh, right.

174
00:11:46,759 --> 00:11:48,919
I have a gift for you.

175
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:54,600
Why did you get me this?

176
00:11:59,559 --> 00:12:00,440
Do you like it?

177
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:03,480
I love it.

178
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,000
But...

179
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:09,879
But why did you get me a gift?

180
00:12:10,639 --> 00:12:11,879
You study medicine, after all.

181
00:12:12,159 --> 00:12:13,200
Time is crucial.

182
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:14,360
Wearing a watch...

183
00:12:14,799 --> 00:12:15,879
...will be more convenient.

184
00:12:17,399 --> 00:12:19,399
I'm sorry. For Yaoyao's sake...

185
00:12:19,399 --> 00:12:21,000
...I have to let you down for now.

186
00:12:23,879 --> 00:12:25,000
By the way, Gu Ting,

187
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,159
there's something...

188
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:37,720
I think right now,

189
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:38,799
it's not very convenient for you to stay at my place.

190
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:41,559
Why?

191
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,639
We've only known each other for a short time.

192
00:12:44,159 --> 00:12:45,399
If you keep staying here,

193
00:12:45,399 --> 00:12:46,600
your dad will be worried sick.

194
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:47,639
True,

195
00:12:47,639 --> 00:12:49,240
your dad does have a bad temper.

196
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,279
But he's a good person.

197
00:12:50,279 --> 00:12:51,799
How about you go back home for a while?

198
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,720
And have a good talk with him.

199
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,759
Did my dad come looking for you?

200
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:55,600
No, no, no.

201
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,720
I knew it.

202
00:12:56,879 --> 00:12:57,879
Otherwise, how could you...

203
00:12:57,879 --> 00:12:59,360
...suddenly kick me out for no reason?

204
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:00,559
No, Gu Ting.

205
00:13:00,559 --> 00:13:02,600
Don't be afraid. I'll go back and confront him right now.

206
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,320
No, no.

207
00:13:03,679 --> 00:13:05,159
Gu Ting!

208
00:13:24,639 --> 00:13:26,799
Didn't I tell you to stop bothering Li Wen?

209
00:13:28,519 --> 00:13:29,159
I didn't!

210
00:13:29,159 --> 00:13:30,399
You still say you didn't?

211
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:32,600
He's such a good-tempered person.

212
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,639
If you hadn't threatened him,

213
00:13:33,639 --> 00:13:34,639
why would he kick me out?

214
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,679
Good-tempered?

215
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:38,720
You must be talking about a saint.

216
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:39,919
Let me tell you,

217
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:40,799
that Li Wen...

218
00:13:41,639 --> 00:13:42,360
he threatened me!

219
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:44,399
He's a terrible person!

220
00:13:44,639 --> 00:13:45,240
All right, enough.

221
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,720
You've said that a million times.

222
00:13:47,039 --> 00:13:48,240
I thought you'd show some remorse.

223
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,720
But you're still exactly the same.

224
00:13:50,919 --> 00:13:52,360
I mean, he's such a kind person.

225
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:53,720
Why do you have to target him?

226
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:54,679
And even get violent?

227
00:13:54,879 --> 00:13:56,679
Are you going to commit a crime next?

228
00:13:56,759 --> 00:13:59,159
I didn't!

229
00:13:59,159 --> 00:14:01,360
I'm truly so disappointed in you.

230
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,240
Let me tell you this,

231
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:04,200
I'm going to keep staying at Li Wen's place.

232
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,480
If you dare harass him again,

233
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,240
I'm never coming back to this house.

234
00:14:16,679 --> 00:14:17,799
Li Wen!
